뮬레이","x":1608,"y":591,"width":126,"height":36}]},{"text":"션해보자. 우리에게 필요한 것은 고객들이 기다리는 평균시간이 얼마나 되느나이다. 만약 기다","words":[{"text":"션해보자.","x":366,"y":649,"width":132,"height":35},{"text":"우리에게","x":515,"y":650,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"필요한","x":653,"y":649,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"것은","x":760,"y":649,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"고객들이","x":832,"y":649,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"기다리는","x":971,"y":650,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"평균시간이","x":1108,"y":650,"width":155,"height":35},{"text":"얼마나","x":1283,"y":649,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"되느나이다.","x":1395,"y":648,"width":176,"height":35},{"text":"만약","x":1592,"y":648,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"기다","x":1675,"y":650,"width":62,"height":35}]},{"text":"리는 시간이 너무 길다면 행원을 더 투입하여 대기시간을 줄여야 할 것이다.","words":[{"text":"리는","x":368,"y":707,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"시간이","x":440,"y":707,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"너무","x":545,"y":707,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"길다면","x":617,"y":707,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"행원을","x":719,"y":707,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"더","x":821,"y":707,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"투입하여","x":861,"y":707,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"대기시간을","x":997,"y":708,"width":154,"height":35},{"text":"줄여야","x":1162,"y":709,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"할","x":1269,"y":708,"width":35,"height":34},{"text":"것이다.","x":1315,"y":706,"width":105,"height":36}]},{"text":"여기서는 최대한 간단히께 설정하여 시뮬레이션의 핵심적인 내용만 알아보자. 먼저 서비스","words":[{"text":"여기서는","x":403,"y":766,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"최대한","x":544,"y":766,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"간단히께","x":650,"y":765,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"설정하여","x":788,"y":765,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"시뮬레이션의","x":927,"y":766,"width":182,"height":34},{"text":"핵심적인","x":1129,"y":767,"width":126,"height":34},{"text":"내용만","x":1274,"y":766,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"알아보자.","x":1389,"y":764,"width":142,"height":35},{"text":"먼저","x":1555,"y":765,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"서비스","x":1640,"y":765,"width":96,"height":34}]},{"text":"하는 행원은 한사람이라고 가정하자. 고객의 대기행릴은 큐로 시뮬레이션된다. 주어진 시간동","words":[{"text":"하는","x":366,"y":825,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"행원은","x":445,"y":824,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"한사람이라고","x":552,"y":824,"width":183,"height":34},{"text":"가정하자.","x":750,"y":823,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"고객의","x":898,"y":824,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"대기행릴은","x":1008,"y":825,"width":154,"height":34},{"text":"큐로","x":1177,"y":827,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"시뮬레이션된다.","x":1258,"y":822,"width":239,"height":36},{"text":"주어진","x":1518,"y":823,"width":103,"height":33},{"text":"시간동","x":1640,"y":823,"width":95,"height":35}]},{"text":"안 고객은 랜덤한 간격으로 큐에 들어온다. 고객들의 서비스 시간도 한계값 안에서 랜덤하게 결","words":[{"text":"안","x":367,"y":883,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"고객은","x":409,"y":883,"width":95,"height":33},{"text":"랜덤한","x":517,"y":882,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"간격으로","x":621,"y":882,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"큐에","x":753,"y":881,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"들어온다.","x":826,"y":881,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"고객들의","x":974,"y":883,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"서비스","x":1112,"y":883,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"시간도","x":1218,"y":883,"width":96,"height":33},{"text":"한계값","x":1327,"y":881,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"안에서","x":1441,"y":880,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"랜덤하게","x":1557,"y":880,"width":131,"height":34},{"text":"결","x":1706,"y":882,"width":25,"height":33}]},{"text":"정된다. 큐에 들어있는 고객들은 순서대로 서비스를 받는다. 한 고객의 서비스가 끝나면 큐의 맨","words":[{"text":"정된다.","x":368,"y":941,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"큐에","x":482,"y":942,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"들어있는","x":555,"y":941,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"고객들은","x":689,"y":940,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"순서대로","x":821,"y":940,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"서비스를","x":958,"y":941,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"받는다.","x":1093,"y":941,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":1209,"y":941,"width":33,"height":33},{"text":"고객의","x":1253,"y":940,"width":94,"heigh